        "r1": "A deliberate prank is incompatible with the required hospital mistake. H03 and H19-H20 support time knowledge and observations, but no answer supplies a prank or deceptive organizers. Knowing a memorial is scheduled can coexist with not knowing a supposed prank, so the nature-of-event wording is not treated as an unambiguous knowledge contradiction.",
