      "rationales": {
        "r1": "Neither mistaken burial/escape nor the prearranged safety code is identified. H19-H21, H23 and H25 support instructions, a trusted sender and secrecy. The postal-box suggestion is explicitly withdrawn, so it is not scored as asserted. The added concern motive and supernatural belief are peripheral.",
        "r2": "Instructions and a trusted intermediary are supported by H19-H21/H23/H25 but are neither required semantic mechanism. Claimed supernatural belief and speculative motives lack support. The expressly rejected forwarding possibility is not a contradiction, and Unknown at H15 is not No."
